    "Owned handler sink requires producer-supplied checked nupp.runtime.core.context declarations, retained owner/source identity and bounded aligned SIZE/DISPATCH_TABLE constants.",
    "Checked compiler input and caller-owned mapped context/table/windows remain preconditions; no arbitrary pointer or mutable-metadata admission claim.",
    "All six graph parameters map directly and all six terminator arguments are forwarded. Handler-to-leaf INTERNAL calls retain exact checked source/signature validation and whole-chain spill bounds.",
