    "The diagnostic shim retains its opaque 32-byte header, now with a 32-byte gap before taggedOffset; this is not core.frames.Frame.",
    "Production default scratch remains 65536. Existing frame stress fixture explicitly requests 131072 and still refuses the too-small default in forced-spill mode."
  ],
